        "roman": "Agar hum chahtay to inn ki aankhen bey noor ker detay phir yeh rastay ki taraf dortay phirtay lekin enhen kaisay dikhaee deta",
        "audio": "https://everyayah.com/data/Hani_Rifai_192kbps/036066.mp3"
