      "roman": "Surah Al-Inshiqaq (الإنشقاق) Nuzooli tartib ke mutabiq #83 par nazil hui. Yeh Late Makki ka ahem hissa hai jisme deen-e-Islam ki hidayat aur roohani rehnumai bayan ki gayi hai.",
