        "roman": "Allah Taalaa wohi hai jiss ney tumhen kamzori ki halat mein peda kiya phir uss kamzori kay baad tawanaee di phir uss tawanaee kay baad kamzori aur burhapa diya jo chahata hai peda kerta hai woh sab say poora waqif aur sab per poora qadir hai",
