        "roman": "Yehi woh log hain jo kehtay hain kay jo log rasool-lullah kay pass hain unn per kuch kharach na kero yahan tak kay woh idhar udhar ho jayen aur aasman-o-zamin kay kul khazaney Allah Taalaa ki milkiyat hain lekin yeh munfiq bey samajh hain",
